	"Name": "Kenneth's Dessert Shop",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"Description": "[b]Adds a new constructible building - Kenneth's Dessert Shop (built by Robin) - with 30 custom dessert foods to buy, each with its own cooking recipe and buffs![/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]Customization: By default, all desserts appear in the shop. If you prefer a smaller selection and have Generic Mod Config Menu (GMCM) installed, you can disable individual desserts to remove them from the shop along with their cooking recipes. Re-enabling a dessert restores it to the shop and its recipe to your kitchen.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]‎More details can be found in ReadMe.txt[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]‎Please do not reupload or include this mod in modpacks without permission.[/b]",
